81","download_count":2,"created_at":"2026-05-12T17:21:52Z","updated_at":"2026-05-12T17:21:53Z"},{"id":418559993,"node_id":"RA_kwDOPIqU4M4Y8rf5","name":"yatto_signing_pubkey.gpg","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/pgp-encrypted","state":"uploaded","size":3236,"digest":"sha256:2291784b047d2ff50317a886cb2a93e92287c326b77ba1ee517831d5692a9ef6","download_count":6,"created_at":"2026-05-12T17:21:54Z","updated_at":"2026-05-12T17:21:55Z"}],"body":"## What's changed\r\n\r\n### Task Archiving\r\nArchive completed or stale tasks to keep your active workspace clean without deleting the JSON files.\r\n\r\n### Full-text search\r\nThe search bar finds matches in task's descriptions as well now.\r\n\r\n### Task encryption\r\nEncrypt your task and project files at rest using AES-256-GCM for enhanced privacy.\r\n- Encrypted files are stored as base64-encoded text (git-friendly)\r\n- Generate a key with `yatto key generate`\r\n- Enable in config: `[encryption] enable = true` with `key_path` pointing to your key file\r\n\r\n## Changelog\r\n* d9422e51b7c9322c5123885d38f886548e56d98d chore(version): v1.4.0\r\n* 77174f9fa64cd74c5a28187b2f9fe7a7fa2e7760 feat: task archiving and full text search (#102)\r\n* 9e188d46046795d459235db397686bc43810efca feat: task encryption (#103)\r\n\r\n"}
